==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[af]]'' (meaning "[[of]]") + ''[[hverju]]'' (meaning "[to] [[what]]"), the {{dat}} {{singular}} neuter of ''[[hvað]]'' (meaning "[[what]]"). Literally meaning "[[of]] [[what]]".

===Pronoun===
'''[[af]] [[hverju]]'''

# [[why]]?
#* ''[[mamma|Mamma]], '''af hverju''' [[vera|er]] [[himinn|himininn]] [[blár]]?''
#*: [[mommy|Mommy]], '''why''' [[be|is]] the [[sky]] [[blue]]?
#* '''''Af hverju''' [[muna|myndirðu]] [[vilja]] [[fara]] [[til]] [[Spánn|Spánar]]?''
#*: '''Why''' [[would]] [you] [[want]] to [[go]] [[to]] [[Spain]]?

===Usage notes===
Often misspelled as [[afhverju]].

